", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qy6azeqaKxMQ7kNvwGzvJ6E&_nc_oc=AdrYq88a7vAKAPmFROre9BmVjT45Qhn7ss_vJWt12Xso7T1E5_KbIosKulDouARgjeQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0FnxgrsudVSVK4xBHzy9QAZIavHBkBpTbZLEkEuCARyQ&oe=69D7ABF9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n_D2GOkHTA0Q7kNvwFWF7mD&_nc_oc=Adp_yUkCAW-4uiao-sRHvY_1gL-fU6SSrF4Ot0Nx5BLPjCFn4P6i2tBOp5pu5QuEm00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Pev2NrCGEkEttfEBR5MeseUFmLk8ajyyHh1Do5N8o9Q&oe=69D78A8B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NXGwm00qhaEQ7kNvwHT4Ox6&_nc_oc=AdpJjRh9LH2sur9KkxryA4JdSqg2ATiAVG5KMSC4KAo2waEIoBJIBtgdrppXRAMD9no&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3q-OgBZNXyj-h3Ph4g7ezYkkcuLOlolbQlVdjWQ_99pg&oe=69D7890E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel